The Mini Dock app in this directory is licensed under the MIT License, rather
than the GNU General Public License v3 that covers the Windows client in the
root of this repository.

It is a separate program: it runs on the dock, links none of the client's
dependencies, and communicates with the client only over a network socket. MIT
matches the convention of the other apps in the Vobot ecosystem, so this one can
be borrowed from freely.

